## Zadanie 12
```sql
select
p.product_id,
p.product_name,
p.category,
p.base_price,
(select 
avg(base_price)
from course.products p2 
where p.category = p2.category) as category_avg_price
from course.products p
where p.base_price > (
select 
avg(base_price)
from course.products p2 
where p.category = p2.category)
order by p.category, p.base_price desc;
```
